"The full pipeline applies unchanged to real KAGRA PEM magnetometer data."
msgstr "このワークフローは実際の KAGRA PEM 磁力計データにそのまま適用できます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_schumann_resonance.ipynb:180020
#: 85816a0c3a2449d5bb66ab4997604708
msgid ""
"Robust identification depends on combining frequency, width, covariance "
"structure, and time evolution rather than matching canonical Schumann "
"frequencies alone."
msgstr "信頼できる同定には、既知の周波数に合うことだけでなく、幅・共分散構造・時間発展を合わせて見ることが重要です。"

